 * via the GUI or CLI. Run CLI with '--help' for additional information on how to override these arguments.
 * @cliArgs --device "F28002x" --package "80QFP" --part "F28002x_80QFP" --product "C2000MCSDK@1.00.00.00"
 * @versions {"tool":"1.15.0+2786"}
